 993:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp_out.c ****  * Called by tcp_close() to send a segment including FIN flag but not data.
 994:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp_out.c ****  * This FIN may be added to an existing segment or a new, otherwise empty
 995:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp_out.c ****  * segment is enqueued.
 996:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp_out.c ****  *
